message: >-
  If you use Magneto-Optical Detective for an analysis in a publication,
  please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Magneto-Optical Detective
abstract: >-
  A desktop app to plot, pick, fit and export magneto-optical FTIR field
  sweeps: R(B)/R(0) maps, Landau-level picking, model fitting and journal
  figures.
